   "en": "{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 04 00}What?{01 00 00 14 00} Don't tell me!{01 00 00 0a 00} You\nlost the present?!?\n\n{07 06 00}Tha{01 00 00 0a 00}-that's terrible!{01 00 00 0a 00} It had\nall of my personal secrets\ninside!\n{07 08 00}If anyone sees it, I'll be\ntoo embarrassed{01 00 00 0a 00} to ever\nleave the house!",
   "et": "{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 04 00}Mis?{01 00 00 14 00} Ära ütle!{01 00 00 0a 00} Sa\nkaotasid kingituse?!?\n\n{07 06 00}Se{01 00 00 0a 00}-see on kohutav!{01 00 00 0a 00} Seal\nolid kõik mu isiklikud\nsaladused sees!\n{07 08 00}Kui keegi seda näeb, on mul\nliiga piinlik,{01 00 00 0a 00} et kodust\nüldse välja minna!"
  },
