   "id": 1,
   "en": "{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 02 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Excuse me?!{01 00 00 05 00} It's gone?!?{01 00 00 14 00}{01 01 00}\n{07 09 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Oh, no problem.\n\n{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}I was never very good at\nthis whole present thing\nanyway{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{03 03 00 01}",
   "et": "{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 02 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Palun?!{01 00 00 05 00} See on kadunud?!?{01 00 00 14 00}{01 01 00}\n{07 09 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Oh, pole hullu.\n\n{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 14 00}Ma polnud niikuinii kunagi\nväga hea selles kogu\nkinkimise asjas{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{03 03 00 01}"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{07 02 00}WHAT?!{01 00 00 14 00} You LOST it?!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}?!?\n\n{07 06 00}This is terrible.{01 00 00 0a 00} TERRIBLE!{01 01 00}\n{07 08 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}{01 00 00 0a 00} is gonna be\nsooo mad at me again!\nYou're an idiot,\n{04 1f 00}! And I don't\nusually like to call names!",
